    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_m0_col",
      "x": -24.208975544249597,
      "y": 219.290269933876,
      "width": 345.703125,
      "height": 218.5,
      "text": "1. Command ECDH\n   encPubKey + coordPrivKey\n   -> sharedKey for command decrypt\n\n2. Leaf ECDH (binding)\n   coordPrivKey * stateLeaf.pubK -> deactivateSharedKeyHash\n   leaf = H(c1Hash, c2Hash, deactivateSharedKeyHash)\n\n3. Signature\n   stateLeaf pubKey signs deactivate command\n\n4. Current marker decrypt\n   proves old state is active\n\n5. New marker decrypt\n   proves deactivated marker is written\n\n6. Step Core\n   update ActiveStateTree + DeactivateTree",
      "originalText": "1. Command ECDH\n   encPubKey + coordPrivKey\n   -> sharedKey for command decrypt\n\n2. Leaf ECDH (binding)\n   coordPrivKey * stateLeaf.pubK -> deactivateSharedKeyHash\n   leaf = H(c1Hash, c2Hash, deactivateSharedKeyHash)\n\n3. Signature\n   stateLeaf pubKey signs deactivate command\n\n4. Current marker decrypt\n   proves old state is active\n\n5. New marker decrypt\n   proves deactivated marker is written\n\n6. Step Core\n   update ActiveStateTree + DeactivateTree",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
